<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8896] Wrong javadoc for TcpCommunicationSpi.setSlowClientQueueLimit()</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8896</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Javadoc for TcpCommunicationSpi.setSlowClientQueueLimit() says that is should be set to value equal to TcpCommunicationSpi.getMessageQueueLimit().&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;But this is wrong, because first checks back pressure limit and sender thread will be blocked before slow client check. Also, warning checks the value correctly, but message should be &quot;...greater or equal...&quot;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (slowClientQueueLimit &amp;gt; 0 &amp;amp;&amp;amp; msgQueueLimit &amp;gt; 0 &amp;amp;&amp;amp; slowClientQueueLimit &amp;gt;= msgQueueLimit) {
            U.quietAndWarn(log, &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Slow client queue limit is set to a value greater than message queue limit &quot;&lt;/span&gt; +
                &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;(slow client queue limit will have no effect) [msgQueueLimit=&quot;&lt;/span&gt; + msgQueueLimit +
                &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;, slowClientQueueLimit=&quot;&lt;/span&gt; + slowClientQueueLimit + &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&apos;]&apos;&lt;/span&gt;);
        }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
